{"id":"vod_lz_11179","vodId":"11179","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"排球少年","name_cn":"排球少年","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220426-1/7145f9b1db10c00df030c846b2680e5c.jpg"},"summary":"　　童年时一次看电视转播的经历，在少年日向翔阳（村濑步 配音）的心中种下了排球的种子。他在初中时代是排球部的主将，可是人丁寥落的排球部始终没有起色，唯一一场比赛也以惨败告终。在此之后，他终于如愿考入梦寐以求的学府乌野高中，并加入了该校的排球部。当年翔阳在电视上看到的正是乌野 高中的比赛，如今这个学校的排球却正面临着衰败的命运。与宿命的对手和好友影山飞雄（石川界人 配音）聚首于此，心怀排球梦想的少年们将团结一心，带领着乌野这名王者再度振翅高飞……                                     　　本片根据古馆春一的漫画原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-12 14:27:23","classic":true,"classicRank":33,"franchise":"排球少年","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14439_adbd422c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14440_aedebbee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14441_2a6ca3c3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14442_fd08baa7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14443_b91a4e48/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14444_94d87f58/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14445_f0d38e39/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14446_0858f9ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14447_3d7ac60d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14448_d45825f9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14449_9d88635e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14450_b94f9e91/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14451_2a85d091/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250410/14452_2b8bdcfd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"http